STATUS 2026-09-25: EXECUTED-ELSEWHERE. The desktop launcher no longer exists — the bot
moved to the VPS (docs/briefs/VPS-MIGRATION.md, Step 6 result). The three layers below
live in /home/radar/market-radar/preflight.sh as systemd ExecStartPre (node --check
per file, then `src/index.js --preflight` for module scope + the four gates), and the
bounded restart is Restart=on-failure + StartLimitBurst=5/600s. Kept for the layer
